Appendix H — Vocabulary crosswalks

H.1 NCBITaxon↔WCVP

WCVP covers vascular plants: the phylum Tracheophyta within kingdom Plantae. This includes Magnoliopsida (dicots), Liliopsida (monocots), conifers, ferns, lycophytes. It excludes fungi, algae, fish, and animals.

NCBITaxon covers the full tree of life, including Metazoa (33208), Fungi (4751), and Viridiplantae (33090).

Crosswalk rule. For taxa in Tracheophyta, the crosswalk maps NCBITaxon taxon ID to WCVP accepted name plus WCVP taxon ID. For taxa outside Tracheophyta, WCVP has no entry; the framework either declares the taxon out of scope or introduces a second authority (NCBITaxon alone, or another nomenclature for fungi and fish).

